{
  "repository": "https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness",
  "changes": [
    "All source files use one immutable DSH revision; import aliases target the selected local closure.",
    "ScopedStandardSourceBinding.ctx is an opaque RSI object instead of a Cordis Context.",
    "Dockkit keeps upstream geometry and gestures; imports use its local primitive closure. exports.ts is an RSI import adapter.",
    "Product SVG artwork and icon components are unchanged. The RSI root mounts the static sprite; no DSH brand or font assets are imported.",
    "theme-base.css omits the unused brand font declaration; system text/code fonts and focus rules remain.",
    "dockkit-tokens.css retains the full platform token source, adapts selectors to RSI appearance, and repeats dark declarations for system appearance.",
    "slots/index.ts exposes the keyed Hook member overload already implemented by renderer/bindings.tsx.",
    "TabLayout releases scroll offsets when their pane is removed, after child strip cleanup; TabPanel documents this bounded lifetime."
  ],
